{"id":"5ce5e89e178fbbbe","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-interpolation-craig.md","title":"Craig Interpolation Theorem","display":"Craig Interpolation Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-interpolation-craig","aliases":["93-thm-interpolation-craig"],"display":"Craig Interpolation Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-interpolant]]","[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]","[[93-df-craig-interpolation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-interpolation-craig"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-interpolation-craig</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Craig Interpolation Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f7efc342a84d366e\" href=\"?note=f7efc342a84d366e\" title=\"93-df-interpolant\">93-df-interpolant</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eda3df85f724c1ae\" href=\"?note=eda3df85f724c1ae\" title=\"93-df-craig-interpolation\">93-df-craig-interpolation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-interpolation-craig-—-Craig-Interpolation-Theorem\">thm-interpolation-craig — Craig Interpolation Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the concrete classical Hilbert presentation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\)</span> is the type-indexed interpolation property of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eda3df85f724c1ae\" href=\"?note=eda3df85f724c1ae\" title=\"93-df-craig-interpolation\">93-df-craig-interpolation</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\cap\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\cap\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f7efc342a84d366e\" href=\"?note=f7efc342a84d366e\" title=\"93-df-interpolant\">93-df-interpolant</a>，变量支集来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n{}&amp;\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\n\\cap\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\psi\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\theta\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\n\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathsf L,\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n{}&amp;\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\n\\cap\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\psi\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\theta\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\n\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathsf L,\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原来的仅含蕴涵和否定的公式语法，也不改变 Craig₉₃ 的定义。原无条件结论不成立：不同变量 p、q 满足 p ⊢ (q→q)，而该语法不存在无变量公式。当前断言补齐共同变量非空的适用条件；并非宣称原来的全域 Craig₉₃ 已成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-interpolation-craig-—-Craig-Interpolation-Theorem","text":"thm-interpolation-craig — Craig Interpolation Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-interpolant","status":"resolved","id":"f7efc342a84d366e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-interpolant]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"